@gui @endpoints @smoke
Feature: Endpoints Catalog Validation # features/dashboard/gui/gui_endpoints.feature:2

  Background:   # features/dashboard/gui/gui_endpoints.feature:4

  Scenario: Deep Dive into Endpoint Detail                                   # features/dashboard/gui/gui_endpoints.feature:8
    Given I navigate to the dashboard at "http://localhost:3000/dashboard/"  # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:172
    And the "dashboard" page is displayed                                    # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:249
    When I click on the "endpoints_link" in the sidebar                      # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:365
    Then the "endpoints_view" page is displayed                              # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:249
    When I type "health" into the "search_input"                             # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:314
    And I wait for 1 seconds                                                 # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/common_steps.py:4
    When I click on the "endpoint_item"                                      # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:306
    Then the "endpoint_detail" page is displayed                             # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:249
    Then the following elements should contain these texts                   # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:330
      | element     | value                               |
      | back_button | [LANG:endpoints.detail.back_button] |
    And I should see the text "[LANG:endpoints.detail.success_rate]"         # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:59
    And I should see the text "[LANG:endpoints.detail.avg_latency]"          # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:59
    And I should see the "performance_card"                                  # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:348
    And I should see the text "[LANG:endpoints.detail.performance_insights]" # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:59
    And I should see the text "[LANG:endpoints.detail.live_discovery]"       # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:59
    Then I take a screenshot named "endpoints_deep_detail"                   # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:81
    When I click on the "back_button"                                        # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:306
    Then the "endpoints_view" page is displayed                              # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:249
    Then the "title" should contain the text "[LANG:endpoints.view.title]"   # .venv/src/qa-automation-framework/qa_framework/steps/gui_steps.py:322

